# Hotels Booking Platform - Technical Documentation

---

## Executive Summary

The Hotels Booking Platform provides a complete solution for hotel reservation management and payment processing. This system integrates booking workflows, payment validation, and compliance requirements into a unified platform.

**Key Capabilities:**
- Real-time booking management with validation
- PCI DSS compliant payment processing
- ACH and card payment support
- Refund and cancellation workflows

